{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/27b94c57384c930c56ae2d58c924bae2.poster.avif?t=1767912290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/27b94c57384c930c56ae2d58c924bae2.webm?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/27b94c57384c930c56ae2d58c924bae2.mp4?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to<i><strong> Skijoring</strong></i>, the unhinged sport of push and pull!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/7071fb8b7f08c0d1f5c6c156976250a7.poster.avif?t=1767912290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/7071fb8b7f08c0d1f5c6c156976250a7.webm?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/7071fb8b7f08c0d1f5c6c156976250a7.mp4?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>One friend drives the snowmobile, while the other is the skier they're pulling along. You'll work together to perform radical jumps and tricks, boosting your way down the wildest mountains around! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>COOPERATE!</strong></u><br> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run 5 radical peaks as a team in split-screen or remote play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover shortcuts, dodge obstacles, and save each other from deadly falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outrun giant boulders, lethal avalanches, and the paparazzi as a team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/0a860e2bcac9edbb14b4b76210ea6b2a.poster.avif?t=1767912290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/0a860e2bcac9edbb14b4b76210ea6b2a.webm?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/0a860e2bcac9edbb14b4b76210ea6b2a.mp4?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>GYRATE!</strong></u> <br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute stylish moves to impress the crowd. Flip and grind as the Skier, drift and boost as the Snowmobiler, and gain big air to top the scoreboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail tricks to get <strong>RAD </strong>for even crazier boosts.\u00a0Challenge <strong>BLACK DIAMOND MODE</strong>, where <strong>STYLE IS SURVIVAL</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/54f5d681ab586d96fd7d6e45a0175f16.poster.avif?t=1767912290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/54f5d681ab586d96fd7d6e45a0175f16.webm?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023240/extras/54f5d681ab586d96fd7d6e45a0175f16.mp4?t=1767912290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DISCOMBOBULATE!</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://